oai-cn5g-amf.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf","homepage":"https://openairinterface.org/core-network/","size":15479,"stargazers_count":2,"watchers_count":2,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":7,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":31,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"collaborators_only","topics":["openairinterface-cn5g"],"visibility":"public","forks":7,"open_issues":31,"watchers":2,"default_branch":"develop","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/pulls/51","html_url":"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/pull/51","diff_url":"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/pull/51.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/pull/51.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #50\n\nFollow-up to #49. `amf_n2::release_ngap_context_only()` moves a UE to CM-IDLE when its gNB sends a new NG Setup, sends NG Reset or shuts down its SCTP association, but starts no mobile reachable timer: no UE Context Release Complete follows on this path, and only that handler starts the timer. Since #49 stops the timer when the UE comes back, a UE that comes back and then loses its gNB this way has no timer and is never implicitly deregistered (TS 24.501 clause 5.3.7).\n\n### Change\nThe timer start of the UE Context Release Complete handler moves to `amf_n2::start_mobile_reachable_timer()`, and `release_ngap_context_only()` calls it too. The handler's statements and their order are unchanged.\n\n### Testing\nThe AMF has no unit test target, so this was tested live on x86_64: OAI gNB and 4 nrUEs in RF simulator mode, v2.2.2 SMF and UPF. After the UEs registered, `docker restart oai-gnb`; the gNB's new NG Setup makes the AMF call `release_ngap_context_only()` for the 4 UEs.\n\n| AMF | `Releasing NGAP/N2 context only` | `Started mobile reachable timer` | ping after the UEs register again |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| #49 head (`6e703ef3`) | 4 | 0 | 4/4 |\n| this PR on `develop` (`c11538fc`) | 4 | 4 | 4/4 |\n\n`docker/Dockerfile.amf.ubuntu` builds with no warning in the changed files; clang-format reports no change on the changed lines.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/issues/51/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openairinterface/oai-cn5g-amf/issues/51/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]